      "updated_at": "2025-12-27T12:50:10Z",
      "body": "For XML UAFs I do not think it is an easy issue for beginners because there is the Python implementation but thanks for pinpointing the exact cause. I will take care of this myself as I already fixed UAFs for XML in the past.\n\nEDIT: Even if they are not clear duplicate, I'll just consider them under the same issue (that is, `__setitem__/__getitem__`).",
