      "created_at": "2025-12-27T14:45:51Z",
      "updated_at": "2025-12-27T14:45:55Z",
      "body": "To summarize:\n\n- UAF when using slices that mutate the element (whether it's in `__getitem__` or `__setitem__`\n- UAF when using a value which, when converted to a sequence, mutates the element as well (this was https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/143199). This only affects `__setitem__`.",
